<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74233" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξῠ-βελής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sharp-pointed,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἆλτο δ᾽ ὀϊστὸς ὀξυβελής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.126
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. χαῖται,</span> of the
			porcupine's bristles, <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				83.2
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥλιος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					40
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νῶτα καράβου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Opp.
					<u>H.</u>
					2.346
				</span></i>
			 : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόθος ὀ.</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				4.41
			</span></i> : in Prose, of a lancet, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ -ές</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					12.413
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>shooting sharp-pointed,</i> and therefore <i>swift, missiles,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. [ὄργανα],</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθοβολικά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				<u>Bel.</u>
				54.49
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξυβελής, ὁ,</span> with and without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπέλτης,</span>
			<i>an engine for throwing sharp-pointed bolts,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πετροβόλος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				20.85
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				86
			</span></i> ; so <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξυβελικόν</span></b> 
			(sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄργανον</span>), τό, ib.<i><span class="en">
				75
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
